---
// Privacy page: the public Privacy Policy for the caonysh Amazon Ads
// integration. Amazon requires a publicly reachable privacy policy URL for
// its Advertising API application review, so this page is plain static legal
// copy — no Product/Category Config involvement, no runtime data.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Caonysh"
  description="Privacy Policy for the caonysh Amazon Ads integration: what advertising data we access via Login with Amazon, how we use it, how we protect it, and how to revoke access."
>
  <section class="privacy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy for caonysh Amazon Ads Integration</h1>
    <p class="privacy-meta">
      <strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 25, 2026<br />
      <strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 25, 2026
    </p>

    <h2 id="introduction">1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      Shenzhen Kaxi'an Industry and Trade Co., Ltd. ("we", "our", or "us"), operating under the
      brand <strong>caonysh</strong>, respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the data
      accessed through our internal Amazon Advertising API application ("the Application"). This
      Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, store, and safeguard information obtained via
      Login with Amazon (LWA) and the Amazon Ads API.
    </p>

    <h2 id="scope">2. Scope and Purpose of the Application</h2>
    <p>
      The Application is developed and operated by Shenzhen Kaxi'an Industry and Trade Co., Ltd.
      solely for internal business operations, including managing, optimizing, and analyzing
      advertising campaigns for our own brand (<strong>caonysh</strong>) on Amazon marketplaces. We
      do not offer this Application as a public third-party SaaS service, nor do we collect data
      from unaffiliated Amazon sellers.
    </p>

    <h2 id="information-we-collect">3. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When authorized via Login with Amazon (LWA), the Application accesses only the
      advertising-related data strictly necessary for campaign management and performance
      reporting, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Account &amp; Profile Identifiers:</strong> Amazon Advertising Profile IDs,
        marketplace identifiers, and entity names.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Campaign Configurations:</strong> Campaign settings, ad groups, product ads,
        keywords, negative keywords, targets, and bidding strategies.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Advertising Performance Metrics:</strong> Aggregated statistical reports such as
        impressions, clicks, click-through rates (CTR), ad spend, attributed sales, and Advertising
        Cost of Sales (ACOS).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Authentication Credentials:</strong> OAuth 2.0 Access Tokens and Refresh Tokens
        required to maintain authorized API connectivity.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not collect, store, or process any personally identifiable information (PII) of Amazon
      retail customers (such as buyer names, shipping addresses, phone numbers, or payment
      details).
    </p>

    <h2 id="how-we-use">4. How We Use Collected Information</h2>
    <p>
      Shenzhen Kaxi'an Industry and Trade Co., Ltd. uses the collected information exclusively for:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automating and optimizing advertising bids, budgets, and keyword targeting for <strong>caonysh</strong>.</li>
      <li>Generating internal analytics dashboards and performance reports to evaluate return on ad spend (ROAS).</li>
      <li>Monitoring campaign health and diagnosing advertising anomalies.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We <strong>do not</strong> sell, rent, lease, trade, or disclose any Amazon Ads API data or
      OAuth credentials to any external third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 id="storage-security">5. Data Storage, Security, and Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We implement industry-standard technical and organizational safeguards to protect all
      retrieved data:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Encryption in Transit &amp; at Rest:</strong> All communications with Amazon servers
        occur exclusively over encrypted HTTPS (TLS) channels. OAuth tokens and sensitive
        credentials are stored securely with encryption and strict access controls.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Restricted Access:</strong> Access to the Application's database and API credentials
        is limited strictly to authorized engineering and operations personnel at Shenzhen Kaxi'an
        Industry and Trade Co., Ltd.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Data Retention:</strong> Advertising metrics and logs are retained only for as long
        as necessary for internal business analysis and financial reconciliation, after which they
        are securely deleted or anonymized.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="revoking-access">6. Revoking Access and Data Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      Authorized account administrators may revoke the Application's access at any time directly
      through the Amazon Advertising Console under account authorization settings. Upon revocation
      or written request, we will promptly purge all associated OAuth tokens and stored advertising
      data from our systems.
    </p>

    <h2 id="updates">7. Updates to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect operational or regulatory changes.
      Any revisions will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2 id="contact">8. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our data protection practices,
      please contact us:
    </p>
    <ul class="privacy-contact">
      <li>
        <strong>Company Name:</strong> Shenzhen Kaxi'an Industry and Trade Co., Ltd. (shenzhenshikaxiangongmaoyouxiangongsi)
      </li>
      <li><strong>Brand:</strong> caonysh</li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:271744473@qq.com">271744473@qq.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

